Second Listen - source provenance

The application runtime in app/ began from AssemblyAI's official Voice Agent
starter repositories:

- https://github.com/AssemblyAI/voice-agent-starter-python
- https://github.com/AssemblyAI/voice-agent-starter-js

In particular, app/deployment/browser/app.js follows the official JavaScript
starter implementation so that its browser audio and protocol handling remain
compatible with AssemblyAI's reference integration.

Second Listen's project-specific work includes the post-investment agent and
playbook, evidence and action ledgers, cross-debrief history, upload
transcription and review, follow-up note generation, the browser workspace,
tests, deployment configuration, documentation, slides, and demo materials.

The repository-level MIT license applies to project-authored portions. Any
third-party code remains subject to the rights and terms of its respective
owner. AssemblyAI names and marks belong to AssemblyAI.
